  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture/Food Production Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grupo Sun (Sun) will train Angait and Av Guaran indigenous communities in gardening and animal husbandry toreach their goal of food security, Sun will also train the communities in ways to generate incometo improve their quality of life. An external evaluator will document their intercultural approach and how it contributes to stronger community cohesion and organization, and greater advocacy, economic, social and political opportunities for indigenous Paraguayans.</narrative>
  </description>
